@startuml ActivityDiagram
|Public Sector Analyst|
|Domain Expert|
|System|

title Activity Diagram — Classification and Human Review Workflow\nWorkforce Data Processing Tool

skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

|System|
start
:Fetch Dataset (Study Programs & ISCO Taxonomy);
:Preprocess Text & Tokenize\n(Including Bilingual Glossary Enrichment);

|Domain Expert|
:Run Initial Label Matching;
:Verify & Correct Ground-Truth Labels;

|System|
:Train & Fine-tune XLM-RoBERTa\n(Stratified Sampling, Early Stopping);
:Deploy Best Model to Inference Pipeline;

|Public Sector Analyst|
:Submit Study Program via Dashboard;

|System|
:Run Inference (Forward Pass & Ranking);
:Return Top-k Predictions & Attention Visualization;

|Public Sector Analyst|
repeat
    if (Prediction Correct?) then (yes)
        :Accept Mapping;
    else (no)
        :Override/Reject Mapping;
    endif
repeat while (More Predictions to Review?) is (yes)
-> no;

|System|
:Store Review Decisions & Log Feedback;
:Compute Evaluation Metrics (F1, Precision, Recall);

|Domain Expert|
:Review Model Performance;
if (Acceptable?) then (yes)
    :Approve for Production;
else (no)
    :Request Retraining;
endif

|Public Sector Analyst|
:Export Final Report (CSV/PDF);

|System|
:Generate Validated Mapping Report;
stop

footer Figure 3.x.5. Activity Diagram (Swimlane) — Classification and Human Review Workflow.\nShows the simplified end-to-end process. (Created by the author)
@enduml
